      "statement": "Pixel Agents integrates with Claude Code by watching the current user's `~/.claude/projects/` JSONL transcripts; `JsonlWatcher` emits file and line events which `server/index.ts` turns into tracked agents and parser-driven broadcasts to WebSocket clients.",
